2. Refactor Config Assembly: Transition DTOFactory to ConfigTranslator
    [ ] 'config_dtos.py':
        - new member 'class KbSpec'
            - shared_domain_keys, pud_domain_keys and prompt_keys str members
        - 'DTOFactory' and all 'xxDTO' classes: leave completely unchanged in file.
        - new member 'ConfigTranslator':
            - extract_filesets (doms_cfg_dict) -> dict[FileSet]
                - only concerned extraction of named top level filesets into dict of appdomain type FileSet
                - uses existing 'DTOFactory' to do this.
            - extract_domains(doms_cfg_dict, filesetmap) -> [Domain]
                - only concerned extraction of named top level domains into list of appdomain type Domain
                - uses existing 'DTOFactory' to do this.
            - process_sys_cfg (dict) -> (Render, KbSpec)
                - uses existing 'DTOFactory' to do this.

    [ ] 'utilities.py': Refactor RuntimeConfigAssembler to new orchestration flow
        - new set of helpers
            - _get_filesetmap(sharedcfg, pudcfg) -> dict[str->FileSet]
                - shared_sets = helper.extract_filesets(sharedcfg)
                - pud_sets = helper.extract_filesets(pudcfg)
                - merges them so that pud filesets take precedence over shared ones where naming conflict exists (fallback behavour)
            - _create_btn_map(kb_spec, shared_domains, pud_domains)
                - btn_map = {}
                - shr_dom_btns = [btns from kb_spec.shared_domain_keys]
                - if len(shared_domains)>len(shr_dom_btns), raise ex, else zip, add inhabitants then add to btn_map
                - pud_dom_btns = [btns from kb_spec.pud_domain_keys]
                - if len(pud_domains)>len(pud_dom_btns), raise ex, else zip, add inhabitants then add to btn_map
                - prompt_btns = [btns from kb_spec.prompt_keys] -> add to btn_map
                - return btn_map to caller
        - '.assemble': 
            - fileset_map = self._get_filesetmap(shared_cfg, pud_cfg)
            - shared_domains = helper.extract_domains(shared_cfg, fileset_map)
            - pud_domains = helper.extract_domains(pud_cfg, fileset_map)
            - (ui_render, kb_spec) = helper.process_sys_cfg(sys_cfg)
            - btn_map = self._create_btn_map(kb_spec, shared_domains, pud_domains)
            - then construct finished product, return to caller

